        "filing_date": "2026-03-11",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As we acquire or organically open new pharmacies, we offer the following support services and training to each of these directors and their local pharmacy management teams:",
        "start_character": 14586,
        "end_character": 14758
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-102172",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-102172-d4471634864c516b",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-102172",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-11",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As we continue to build out our national footprint, we believe we are an increasingly attractive provider to ALF operators that value our services and approach, but prefer a vendor with a broad geographic reach.",
        "start_character": 34743,
        "end_character": 34954
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-102172",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-102172-d4471634864c516b",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-102172",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-11",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Finally, we offer an Order Entry QA Analyzer, which is designed to utilize real-time rules- engine technology to examine prescriptions and detect omissions and/or errors before they become a customer service problem.",
        "start_character": 21098,
        "end_character": 21314
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-102172",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-102172-d4471634864c516b",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-102172",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-11",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "For the year ended December 31, 2025, we provided pharmacy services to approximately 205,000 residents in approximately 8,400 LTCFs across 38 states.",
        "start_character": 43109,
        "end_character": 43258
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-102172",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-102172-d4471634864c516b",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-102172",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-11",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition to the services we provide to LTCFs generally, we provide ALFs and BHFs with tailored services that enhance their abilities as caregivers to their residents.",
        "start_character": 5717,
        "end_character": 5886
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-102172",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-102172-d4471634864c516b",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-102172",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-11",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In the future, we anticipate that we will structure our acquisitions and greenfield start-ups in a manner similar to our business development strategy prior to our IPO.",
        "start_character": 37462,
        "end_character": 37630
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-102172",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-102172-d4471634864c516b",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-102172",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-11",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Most LTCF contracts specify certain facility-wide services that we may provide for a fee, including EMAR support, consulting services and training.",
        "start_character": 45032,
        "end_character": 45179
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-102172",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-102172-d4471634864c516b",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-102172",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-11",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "The data analytics tools and customer service we are able to offer through GuardianShield have downstream benefits for LTCFs and pharmacy benefit plans that we believe are unmatched in the industry.",
        "start_character": 18027,
        "end_character": 18225
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-102172",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-102172-d4471634864c516b",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-102172",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-11",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Upon acquisition, we are typically able to significantly enhance the profitability and margin of the acquired pharmacy by implementing our IT services and leveraging our purchasing, revenue cycle management and national sales capabilities.",
        "start_character": 37050,
        "end_character": 37289
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-102172",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-102172-d4471634864c516b",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-102172",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-11",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe our business development model provides us with a material advantage in attracting and completing acquisitions, particularly when pharmacy owners have multiple competitive sale alternatives.",
        "start_character": 38631,
        "end_character": 38832
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-102172",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-102172-d4471634864c516b",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-102172",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-11",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe that our business model promoting local management autonomy, combined with our centralized corporate support, results in superior service to LTCFs and their residents.",
        "start_character": 13501,
        "end_character": 13679
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-102172",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-102172-d4471634864c516b",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-102172",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-11",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe that our existing market share, the size of our market opportunity, our strategic approach to high-touch, individualized services and favorable market dynamics provides us with a significant opportunity for future growth.",
        "start_character": 31737,
        "end_character": 31969
      }
